{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minefield Fractalis</strong> is a puzzle-strategy game that re-imagines classic <strong>Minesweeper</strong> through a recursive, fractal structure. In this game, revealing a &quot;mine&quot; does not end your run; it opens a gateway to another, deeper battlefield nested within that very cell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core interaction is simple: reveal or flag, but the consequences are dictated by\u00a0the specific, often cryptic, logic of each sub-battle.\u00a0The outcome ripples back to the parent grid: a victory might clear the original cell, while a loss could damage your armor or alter the surrounding area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across distinct worlds, each defined by its own\u00a0set of mechanics and the information they yield. Your goal is to navigate these interlocking systems,\u00a0decipher their governing mechanics, and exploit their logic\u00a0to bring order to chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decipher the rules. Navigate the layers. Solve the system from the inside out.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Small Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886360/271e96bdcc60d7898681179f2e26ffd1f55fd7cc.jpg"},{"name":"To the Core","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886360/7a08fe8d3d88bd8d657bcc498a5e014be28cf266.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886360/074abe52a79d2ad9db86f73ce9e9eeb843235240.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Victor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886360/2f364e6d8a98fa9d27dcc063d0e4c3bddcbfc474.jpg"},{"name":"Flag Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886360/5afd03568b9a2350dccf9ecc3e4